{"id":"baie","lemma":"baie","pos":"noun","rank":3823,"glosses":["berry"],"ipa":"/bɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Fr-baie.ogg/Fr-baie.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"baies"},"formAudio":{"baies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-baies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les baies peuvent être congelées.","en":"Berries can be frozen.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"La marée noire a pollué la baie.","en":"The oil spill polluted the bay.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to pollute","l":"polluer"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"an oil spill"]]},{"text":"Thomas prit quelques baies et les mangea.","en":"Tom picked some berries and ate them.","words":[null,{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"}]},{"text":"On nous a octroyé le privilège de pouvoir pêcher dans cette baie.","en":"We were granted the privilege of fishing in this bay.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"privilege"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"to fish"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]}]}